<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 1947 0 R/Alt(A map of the proof. Silent cards lead to the congruence test, then to the five moduli, and to the two families. Negatives flip and the wastebasket lead to hands with a 0. The two families, hands with a 0 and big hands lead to the single group theorem, and the single group theorem and the two families lead to the classification. Big hands is checked by computer, and the single group theorem and the classification rest on it.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[0 1933 0 R 2 1934 0 R 4 1935 0 R 6 1936 0 R 8 1937 0 R 10 1938 0 R 12 1939 0 R 14 1940 0 R 16 1941 0 R 1942 0 R 1943 0 R 1944 0 R 1945 0 R]/Pg 3314 0 R>>
